OL,3,ATip-off foiled US teen's plot to attack
OL,4,AHindu temple, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Taco Bell cashier's alleged plot for
OL,7,Fa mass shooting at a Hindu temple near
OL,8,FChicago was thwarted by a tip-off from
OL,9,Fone of his colleagues, investigators
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FAlexandros Paporakis, 19, from
OL,13,FPalatine, Illinois, appeared in court
OL,14,Fon Wednesday charged with one count of
OL,15,Fmaking a terrorist threat and one count
OL,16,Fof unlawful possession of a weapon.
OL,18,FPaporakis allegedly sent a message
OL,19,Fabout the planned attack on Sunday to
OL,20,Fthe co-worker, who alerted authorities,
OL,21,Fofficials said.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
